    "rich_text_F3p8N3": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_tqbTze": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Top-Quality Craftsmanship",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "heading_font_class": "fs-heading-3-base"
          }
        },
        "text_VH4Fj4": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Our wholesale candles are crafted with care to ensure a clean, dripless burn and a smoke-free experience. From the wax to the wick, every detail is designed for longevity and performance, perfect for events, retail displays, and atmospheric dining settings.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        },
        "spacer_iTqJBG": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 40
          }
        },
        "heading_PTepEn": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Competitive Bulk Pricing",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "heading_font_class": "fs-heading-3-base"
          }
        },
        "text_M9XWVL": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Get more for less with wholesale-only pricing that respects your budget. Bulk pricing lets you bring premium candles to your clients without breaking the bank, helping you maintain profitability while delivering quality. Whether you need <a href=\"https://kiscocandles.com/collections/elegant-wedding-candles\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">elegant wedding candles</span></a> or candles that are <a href=\"https://kiscocandles.com/collections/scented-candles\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">scented</span></a> or <a href=\"https://kiscocandles.com/collections/unscented-candles\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">unscented</span></a>, we have the perfect solution for you. </p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        },
        "spacer_yWFNr3": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 40
          }
        },
        "heading_9Hpz9P": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Exclusive Products Just for Wholesalers",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "heading_font_class": "fs-heading-3-base"
          }
        },
        "text_gWjmtx": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Access a range of bulk candles for businesses/event planners/venues created specifically for our wholesale partners. From <a href=\"https://kiscocandles.com/pages/shop-by-color\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">custom colors</span></a> and sizes to limited-edition styles, you’ll find options that help your business stand out, meeting the unique demands of your clientele.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_tqbTze",
