    "rich_text_6XyK3D": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_hV7RCJ": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Wholesale Discounts and Special Pricing Tiers",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "heading_font_class": "fs-heading-3-base"
          }
        },
        "text_6bDE9T": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Our tiered pricing structure lets you scale purchases to your needs, so whether you’re buying for a single event or stocking up for retail, you’re getting the best possible value with every order.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        },
        "spacer_AhMX3M": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 40
          }
        },
        "heading_L6WAB3": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Effortless Order Management",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "heading_font_class": "fs-heading-3-base"
          }
        },
        "text_tCUnEJ": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Our exclusive B2B portal simplifies the order process, letting you place, track, and manage all orders in one place. Spend less time navigating logistics and more time planning for growth.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        },
        "spacer_4QTdQY": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 40
          }
        },
        "heading_Ez3TtH": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Dedicated Support for Wholesale Clients",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "heading_font_class": "fs-heading-3-base"
          }
        },
        "text_XHTkeW": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>From quick answers to product guidance, your dedicated account representative ensures you’re fully supported every step of the way. Kisco is here to make your wholesale experience as smooth and reliable as possible.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        },
        "spacer_xPQKYQ": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 40
          }
        },
        "heading_yEekPy": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Access to Marketing Materials and Product Samples",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "heading_font_class": "fs-heading-3-base"
          }
        },
        "text_zgPKWD": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Help your customers experience Kisco quality firsthand. With sample products and marketing support available, you can showcase our candles in a way that drives interest and sales.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        },
        "spacer_imb4DF": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 40
          }
        },
        "heading_Ni7fXp": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "A Variety of Candle Types to Suit Every Setting",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "heading_font_class": "fs-heading-3-base"
          }
        },
        "text_XcmMiB": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Whether you need the steady glow of a pillar, the elegance of tapers, or the gentle ambiance of floating candles, Kisco’s range of wholesale <a href=\"https://kiscocandles.com/collections/bolsius-candles\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Bolsius candles</span></a> is curated to fit seamlessly into any business setting—from retail displays to memorable event decor.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        },
        "spacer_VgAdWr": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 40
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_hV7RCJ",
