    "rich_text_3CLz68": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "spacer_HYQD6a": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 40
          }
        },
        "heading_tWJiXD": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Frequently Asked Questions",
            "heading_tag": "h2",
            "heading_font_class": "fs-heading-2-base"
          }
        },
        "border_fGa4bk": {
          "type": "border",
          "settings": {}
        },
        "text_kVwpHb": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We’re here to make your wholesale experience with Kisco Candles as smooth and seamless as possible. Below, you’ll find answers to some of the most common questions about our wholesale program, policies, and products. If you have additional questions, feel free to reach out—we’re here to help!</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        },
        "spacer_Vr7KYB": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 40
          }
        },
        "heading_ekJiDn": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What are the benefits of creating a wholesale account?",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "heading_font_class": "fs-heading-3-base"
          }
        },
        "text_LcYQQb": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>With a Kisco Candles wholesale account, you gain access to exclusive bulk pricing, free shipping on qualifying orders, an easy-to-use ordering portal with order history tracking, and a dedicated account representative to assist with your needs.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        },
        "spacer_jJ6AAE": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 40
          }
        },
        "heading_in6Ktx": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is there a minimum order requirement?",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "heading_font_class": "fs-heading-3-base"
          }
        },
        "text_Cnkkhp": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Yes, wholesale orders are typically subject to minimum quantity requirements, allowing us to provide the best value to bulk purchasers.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        },
        "spacer_zimeQz": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 40
          }
        },
        "heading_yNnBTb": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What types of candles are available for wholesale purchase?",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "heading_font_class": "fs-heading-3-base"
          }
        },
        "text_PmxG6g": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Our wholesale offerings include a variety of candle types—such as pillar, taper, floating, and votive candles—to suit the needs of event planners, retailers, and hospitality businesses. Each type is available in multiple sizes and colors.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        },
        "spacer_tKFzPk": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 40
          }
        },
        "heading_FEFdBg": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Do you offer custom candle options?",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "heading_font_class": "fs-heading-3-base"
          }
        },
        "text_N8PHCt": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Yes, we provide custom options for wholesale orders, ideal for businesses seeking specific sizes, colors, or styles for events and branding consistency.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        },
        "spacer_Yjic7H": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 40
          }
        },
        "heading_anqhxE": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How does your return policy work?",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "heading_font_class": "fs-heading-3-base"
          }
        },
        "text_UMr8HD": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Kisco Candles offers a 30-day return policy. Items must be returned in their original condition and packaging, accompanied by a receipt or proof of purchase. Returns must be requested by contacting support to ensure eligibility and instructions.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        }
      },
